.TH batten-record-release 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-record\-release \- Record a published release\*(Aqs assets, its checksum manifest\*(Aqs entries, and the entries whose bytes disagree
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten record release\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-manifest\fR> [\fItag\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record a published release\*(Aqs assets, its checksum manifest\*(Aqs entries, and the entries whose bytes disagree
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-manifest\fR \fI<manifest>\fR
The checksum manifest\*(Aqs file name, as the release carries it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fItag\fR]
The release\*(Aqs tag; empty or absent is the latest release
